@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:durability] message-board-profile-uniqueness
Each user MUST have at most one message board per supported machine profile.
Board creation MUST be idempotent under concurrent retries.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:durability] message-board-request-idempotency
Posting with the same author, profile and request key MUST return the original
post when the body matches and MUST reject a conflicting body.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:recovery] message-board-machine-purge
Stopping or suspending a machine MUST remove every post tagged with that VM,
including posts created by machines admitted outside Threads.
